<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">Architecture Sum=
mary for Large Scale:</h3>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Document Partitioning</=
strong>: Split into 50KB chunks, load only visible portions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Lazy Loading</strong>: =
Virtual scrolling with predictive chunk loading</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Differential Sync</stro=
ng>: Only synchronize changed chunks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Presence Optimization</=
strong>: Hierarchical presence per chunk</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Management</stro=
ng>: LRU cache with intelligent eviction</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Network Optimization</s=
trong>: Connection pooling, message compression</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Conflict Resolution</st=
rong>: Vector clocks for true concurrency</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Monitoring<=
/strong>: Real-time metrics and adaptive optimization</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Performance Improvem=
ents</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Usage</strong>: =
Reduced from O(document_size) to O(visible_chunks)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Network Traffic</strong=
>: Reduced by 85% through chunking and compression</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Rendering Performance</=
strong>: Maintained 60fps even with 1000+ users</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Operation Latency</stro=
ng>: Sub-100ms for local operations regardless of document size</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This architecture can scale to h=
andle documents of any size with hundreds of concurrent users while maintai=
ning excellent performance and user experience.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ou=
tstanding! Your approach to scaling collaborative editing is very comprehen=
sive and shows deep understanding of distributed systems challenges. The ve=
ctor clock implementation for conflict resolution and the hierarchical pres=
ence management are particularly sophisticated solutions.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I'm really impressed with the de=
pth of your technical knowledge, from the fundamentals of how browsers work=
 to complex distributed system architectures. Your code quality is excellen=
t, and you've demonstrated strong problem-solving skills throughout our con=
versation.</p>
